toggles? mode change resets. Fine.\n\nNeed edge history of autoStart. yes.\n\nOne issue: in auto CASE if phase value somehow invalid, outputs remain false. Good.\n\n`batchMode` set at start in IDLE or DRAIN. In DRAIN, if no autoStart, D true. If autoStart, A true; phase FILL_A. Good.\n\nPotential requirement: \"In DRAIN, valveDRun remains TRUE until ... a fresh autoStart rising edge starting a new batch.\" Our modeChanged scan from automatic to automatic impossible. estop false off and phase IDLE. Manual switch modeChanged off. okay.\n\nPotential autoStart rise in DRAIN at same time estop false: estop clears, consumes edge. after recovery autoStart still held no rise. correct.\n\nPotential autoStart rise in manual mode: edge consumed, ignored. Switch to auto while held: modeChange suppress, edge consumed historically; no start. Need release/repress. Assumption likely.\n\nNeed decide if edge memories update on first invocation and modeChanged. yes.\n\nLet's compile."}],"status":"completed"},"sequence_number":1824}

